herolte: read the audio codec before gating and after restoring the audio domain (0460)

min91 (E-0308) restored all eight domains but nothing showed that audio still works afterwards. With herostep and heroaudio set, step 1 reads codec register 0 over SPI just before gating the audio domain and again right after restoring it, logging "codec register 0 reads 0x6364" (the value Linux reads). It proves the codec answers over SPI, not that I2S/ABOX plays sound. herostep only.

